### OAuth2 Implicit

The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```python
from {{packageName}}.auth.oauth.oauth2_implicit_authenticator import OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator

authenticator = OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator(
    "https://api.example.com", "client-id", "https://auth.example.com/authorize", ["read"])
authenticator.set_access_token("your-access-token")
client = {{clientClassName}}(authenticator)
```

{{/hasOAuth2Implicit}}
